      "copy": "Module 1 of the Hermes Agent Masterclass \u2014 starting completely from zero and building up to a fully configured, compounding AI agent over 11 episodes.\n\nSign up for my FREE weekly newsletter, where I spill my unfiltered thoughts on the latest AI news, cool research, and projects I'm building: https://www.onchainaigarage.com/\n\n\ud83d\udc26 Follow Tonbi on X for real-time AI x blockchain updates! https://x.com/tonbistudio\n\nWelcome to the Hermes Agent Master Class \u2014 an 11-episode series taking you from zero to fully leveraging every feature of Nous Research's open-source agent. In this first episode, we install Hermes from scratch on a brand new machine with no prior skills or memory, walk through full configuration with OpenRouter, tour the most important CLI and slash commands, and run our first real task: a competitor research report on a custom children's book AI business idea. Every future episode will build on this fresh install so you can see the compounding value of the agent in real time.\n\n\u2705 Full installation walkthrough on WSL 2 with dependency setup, provider configuration, and fallback routing for API keys.\n\u2705 Tour of the top 10 CLI commands and top 10 in-chat slash commands, including mid-session model switching with no reboot required.\n\u2705 First real task: live competitor research and market gap analysis for an AI-powered children's book business using Tavily web search.\n\n\ud83d\udcbb Tonbi's GitHub: https://github.com/tonbistudio\n\ud83c\udf10 Portfolio: https://www.tonbistudio.com\n\nResources:\n\ud83d\udd17 Hermes Agent (Nous Research): https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent\n\ud83d\udd17 OpenRouter: https://openrouter.ai/\n\ud83d\udd17 Tavily (Web Search API): https://tavily.com/\n\ud83d\udd17 WSL 2 Install Guide: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/install\n\nTimestamps:\n0:00 - Intro: Master Class overview and what you'll learn\n0:53 - What is Hermes Agent and why it exists\n2:12 - The compounding value thesis: why sessions build on each other\n4:02 - Installation walkthrough on WSL 2\n6:48 - Full configuration: providers, fallbacks, and context management\n12:30 - Launching Hermes chat and touring available tools\n13:08 - Top 10 CLI commands\n16:43 - Top 10 in-chat slash commands\n19:40 - Where everything lives: the .hermes directory\n21:26 - First real task: competitor research on an AI business idea\n\nComing Next:\nEpisode 2 of the Masterclass: deployment options and messaging \u2014 hooking Hermes up to Telegram and other platforms so you can chat with your agent from anywhere! \ud83d\udc40\n\nFollowing along with the Master Class? Drop your setup questions in the comments and I'll answer them in future episodes! Full series available on the AI Garage school community with select episodes on YouTube. If this helped you get started, please like, subscribe, and hit the bell! \ud83e\udd90\u2728\n\n#HermesAgent #NousResearch #AIAgent #MasterClass #LocalLLM #OpenRouter #AITools #LLM #AgentSetup #AIWorkflow #WSL #Tavily",
